      "writtenOn": "2022-02-22T10:41:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC this might cause a memory leak, because if the private DNS setting changes while a network is pending replacement, handlePrivateDnsSettingsChanged will call mDnsManager.updatePrivateDns on all networks in mNetworkAgentInfos, adding back this network to the map in DnsManager, never to be removed. To be sure it\u0027s a small leak, and very unlikely.\n\nSo strictly speaking I think mDnsManager.removeNetwork actually belongs with mNetworkAgentInfos.remove(). The native cache is already removed in l.4332, and no LP changes can touch mDnsManager after this (though... it might be a bit of a landmine)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4336,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 4336,
